{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_41","type":"mcp_tool_call","server":"toolshed_web_search","tool":"call_web_search","arguments":{"web_search_instructions":"site:prodigi.com apparel sku t-shirt \"center_chest\" Prodigi API SKU"},"result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Research Report: Prodigi API SKU for T-Shirts with Center Chest Print Area\n\n## Executive Summary\n\nProdigi's Print API offers a range of apparel products, including t-shirts, with customizable print areas such as the center chest. Each product is identified by a unique SKU, which specifies attributes like available colors, sizes, and printable areas. Understanding these SKUs and their associated attributes is essential for integrating and utilizing Prodigi's API effectively.\n\n## Key Findings\n\n- **Finding 1:** Prodigi's Print API provides detailed product information through the Product Details endpoint, which includes SKU, description, dimensions, attributes, print areas, and available variants. ([prodigi.com](https://www.prodigi.com/print-api/docs/reference/?utm_source=openai))\n\n- **Finding 2:** For t-shirts, the API supports print areas such as \"center_chest\" and \"center_back,\" with specific image dimensions required for each area. ([dashboard.dev.kitely.prodigi.tech](https://dashboard.dev.kitely.prodigi.tech/docs/?utm_source=openai))\n\n- **Finding 3:** Each t-shirt SKU specifies available colors and sizes, ensuring precise customization options for end-users. ([dashboard.dev.kitely.prodigi.tech](https://dashboard.dev.kitely.prodigi.tech/docs/?utm_source=openai))\n\n- **Finding 4:** The API accepts image files in JPG, PNG, or PDF formats, with specific requirements for each product to ensure optimal print quality. ([prodigi.com](https://www.prodigi.com/faq/print-api/?utm_source=openai))\n\n---\n\n## Detailed Source Analysis\n\n### Source 1: Print API Reference\n\n- **URL:** [https://dashboard.dev.kitely.prodigi.tech/docs/](https://dashboard.dev.kitely.prodigi.tech/docs/)\n\n- **Domain:** dashboard.dev.kitely.prodigi.tech\n\n- **Publication Date:** Date not specified\n\n- **Source Type:** Documentation\n\n- **Credibility:** High (Official API documentation)\n\n**Summary:**\n\nThis source provides comprehensive details on Prodigi's Print API, including product templates, applicable print positions, available colors, and sizes. It specifies that t-shirts can have print areas like \"center_chest\" and \"center_back,\" with required image dimensions of 2100 x 2400 pixels (30x40 cm). The documentation also lists various t-shirt SKUs, their corresponding colors, and size options.\n\n**Key Data Points:**\n\n- Print area \"center_chest\" requires an image of 2100 x 2400 pixels.\n\n- Available t-shirt colors include black, white, and heather grey.\n\n- Sizes range from small (s) to extra-large (xl).\n\n**Notable Quotes:**\n\n> \"All apparel orders must be made with options and sizes that correspond to the product ordered as detailed in the below table.\"\n\n---\n\n### Source 2: Prodigi API Documentation\n\n- **URL:** [https://www.prodigi.com/print-api/docs/reference/](https://www.prodigi.com/print-api/docs/reference/)\n\n- **Domain:** www.prodigi.com\n\n- **Publication Date:** Date not specified\n\n- **Source Type:** Documentation\n\n- **Credibility:** High (Official API documentation)\n\n**Summary:**\n\nThis documentation outlines the Product Details endpoint of Prodigi's API, which returns comprehensive data for a given SKU. The endpoint provides information such as product dimensions, attributes, print areas, and available variants. It emphasizes the importance of specifying the correct SKU to retrieve accurate product information.\n\n**Key Data Points:**\n\n- The Product Details endpoint returns data including SKU, description, dimensions, attributes, and print areas.\n\n- Attributes may include options like color and size.\n\n- Print areas are specified with details on required assets and dimensions.\n\n**Notable Quotes:**\n\n> \"The Product Details endpoint returns all available data for a SKU, such as available destinations, attributes, and its required assets and dimensions.\"\n\n---\n\n### Source 3: Print API FAQ\n\n- **URL:** [https://www.prodigi.com/faq/print-api/](https://www.prodigi.com/faq/print-api/)\n\n- **Domain:** www.prodigi.com\n\n- **Publication Date:** Date not specified\n\n- **Source Type:** FAQ\n\n- **Credibility:** High (Official FAQ)\n\n**Summary:**\n\nThis FAQ addresses common questions about Prodigi's Print API, including accepted image file types and handling of images that don't fit the product print area. It specifies that the API accepts JPG, PNG, or PDF files and describes default behaviors for images that don't match the print area's aspect ratio.\n\n**Key Data Points:**\n\n- Accepted image formats are JPG, PNG, and PDF.\n\n- Default behavior for mismatched images is central cropping to fit the print area.\n\n- Alternative sizing parameters can be specified to change default behavior.\n\n**Notable Quotes:**\n\n> \"If your image doesn’t fit the product size, by default, we’ll crop your image centrally.\"\n\n---\n\n## Cross-Reference Analysis\n\n**Consensus Across Sources:**\n\n- Prodigi's Print API provides detailed product information through the Product Details endpoint, including SKU, description, dimensions, attributes, and print areas. ([prodigi.com](https://www.prodigi.com/print-api/docs/reference/?utm_source=openai))\n\n- T-shirts support print areas like \"center_chest\" and \"center_back,\" with specific image dimension requirements. ([dashboard.dev.kitely.prodigi.tech](https://dashboard.dev.kitely.prodigi.tech/docs/?utm_source=openai))\n\n**Conflicting Information:**\n\n- No significant conflicting information was identified across the sources.\n\n**Information Gaps:**\n\n- Specific SKUs for t-shirts with \"center_chest\" print areas are not explicitly listed in the provided sources.\n\n- Detailed pricing information for these products is not available in the analyzed sources.\n\n---\n\n## Research Metadata\n\n- **Search Completed:** 2026-08-25T22:21:35Z\n\n- **Sources Analyzed:** 3 sources\n\n- **Total Content Reviewed:** Approximately 1,200 words\n\n- **Search Confidence:** High (Based on source quality and coverage)\n\n--- "}],"_meta":{"openai/widgetSessionId":"ac60c34d-5295-4cbe-837b-0fc5eb3cfae5"},"structured_content":null},"error":null,"status":"completed"}}
