{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_44","type":"mcp_tool_call","server":"toolshed_web_search","tool":"call_web_search","arguments":{"web_search_instructions":"\"Prodigi SKU\" \"t-shirt\" \"black\""},"result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Research Report: \"Prodigi SKU\" \"t-shirt\" \"black\"\n\n## Executive Summary\n\nProdigi offers a diverse range of customizable black t-shirts suitable for various applications, including print-on-demand services. Their catalog features multiple styles and brands, providing flexibility for businesses and individuals seeking personalized apparel solutions.\n\n## Key Findings\n\n- **Finding 1:** Prodigi's t-shirt collection includes various styles such as activewear, classic, long sleeve, tank tops, triblend, baseball, polo, and v-neck, catering to diverse customer preferences. ([prodigi.com](https://www.prodigi.com/products/mens-clothing/t-shirts/?utm_source=openai))\n\n- **Finding 2:** The company collaborates with reputable brands like Bella+Canvas, Gildan, and Stanley/Stella to offer high-quality t-shirts, ensuring durability and comfort. ([prodigi.com](https://www.prodigi.com/products/unisex-apparel/?utm_source=openai))\n\n- **Finding 3:** Prodigi's t-shirts are available in a wide range of sizes and colors, including black, allowing for extensive customization options to meet specific design requirements. ([prodigi.com](https://www.prodigi.com/products/mens-clothing/t-shirts/?utm_source=openai))\n\n- **Finding 4:** The t-shirts are crafted from robust textiles suitable for all seasons, making them versatile for various occasions and uses. ([prodigi.com](https://www.prodigi.com/products/mens-clothing/t-shirts/?utm_source=openai))\n\n---\n\n## Detailed Source Analysis\n\n### Source 1: Print on Demand T-Shirts - Print API, Dropshipping\n\n- **URL:** ([prodigi.com](https://www.prodigi.com/products/mens-clothing/t-shirts/?utm_source=openai))\n\n- **Domain:** prodigi.com\n\n- **Publication Date:** Date not specified\n\n- **Source Type:** Commercial\n\n- **Credibility:** High (Official company website providing detailed product information)\n\n**Summary:**\n\nProdigi offers a comprehensive selection of customizable t-shirts suitable for print-on-demand services. The collection encompasses various styles, including activewear, classic, long sleeve, tank tops, triblend, baseball, polo, and v-neck. These t-shirts are made from robust textiles appropriate for all seasons, ensuring durability and comfort. The range is designed to cater to diverse customer preferences and applications.\n\n**Key Data Points:**\n\n- Multiple t-shirt styles available: activewear, classic, long sleeve, tank tops, triblend, baseball, polo, v-neck.\n\n- Crafted from robust textiles suitable for all seasons.\n\n- Designed for print-on-demand services.\n\n**Notable Quotes:**\n\n> \"Our carefully curated range of premium designer t-shirts are available in an array of on-trend styles and colours.\"\n\n---\n\n### Source 2: Unisex Print on Demand Apparel | Prodigi\n\n- **URL:** ([prodigi.com](https://www.prodigi.com/products/unisex-apparel/?utm_source=openai))\n\n- **Domain:** prodigi.com\n\n- **Publication Date:** Date not specified\n\n- **Source Type:** Commercial\n\n- **Credibility:** High (Official company website providing detailed product information)\n\n**Summary:**\n\nProdigi's unisex apparel collection includes a variety of t-shirts suitable for customization. The range features products from reputable brands such as Bella+Canvas, Gildan, and Stanley/Stella, ensuring high-quality materials and construction. These t-shirts are available in multiple sizes and colors, including black, providing ample options for personalization.\n\n**Key Data Points:**\n\n- Collaborations with brands: Bella+Canvas, Gildan, Stanley/Stella.\n\n- Wide range of sizes and colors available.\n\n- Unisex designs suitable for various applications.\n\n**Notable Quotes:**\n\n> \"Make your designs accessible to everyone with our collection of unisex custom apparel.\"\n\n---\n\n## Cross-Reference Analysis\n\n**Consensus Across Sources:**\n\n- Both sources confirm that Prodigi offers a diverse range of t-shirt styles suitable for customization and print-on-demand services. ([prodigi.com](https://www.prodigi.com/products/mens-clothing/t-shirts/?utm_source=openai))\n\n- The collaboration with reputable brands like Bella+Canvas, Gildan, and Stanley/Stella ensures high-quality products. ([prodigi.com](https://www.prodigi.com/products/unisex-apparel/?utm_source=openai))\n\n**Conflicting Information:**\n\n- No conflicting information was identified across the sources.\n\n**Information Gaps:**\n\n- Specific SKU details for black t-shirts are not provided in the available sources.\n\n- Pricing information for individual t-shirt styles is not specified.\n\n---\n\n## Research Metadata\n\n- **Search Completed:** 2026-08-25T22:21:58Z\n\n- **Sources Analyzed:** 2 sources\n\n- **Total Content Reviewed:** Approximately 400 words\n\n- **Search Confidence:** High (Information sourced from official company website) "}],"_meta":{"openai/widgetSessionId":"19255489-2946-40b5-bc16-ffef98d072c8"},"structured_content":null},"error":null,"status":"completed"}}
