li class=\"mb-2\">...and <a href=\"/prodigi-pro/\" title=\"Prodigi Pro\">more</a></li> </ul> <div class=\"mt-6\"> <a href=\"/prodigi-pro/\" class=\"btn btn-ghost\" title=\"Prodigi Pro\">Prodigi Pro</a> </div> </div> </div> </section> <section id=\"samples\" class=\"container\"> <div class=\"lg:flex mt-16 pt-8 lg:mt-32 lg:pt-12 border-t\"> <h2 class=\"lg:w-1/3 flex flex-col gap-2 mt-0 xl:pr-20 text-xl\"> Product samples </h2> <div class=\"lg:w-2/3 mt-8 lg:mt-0\"> <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-12\"> <div> <h3 class=\"text-lg mt-0\">Sample orders</h3> <p>If you already have a design for a bella+canvas 3001 t-shirt, order now and receive a <strong class=\"whitespace-nowrap\">50% refund</strong> on your first sample product order.</p> <div class=\"mt-6\"> <a href=\"/start/samples/\" class=\"btn btn-ghost\" title=\"About sample orders\">About sample orders</a> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </section> <section id=\"platforms\" class=\"container\"> <div class=\"lg:flex mt-16 pt-8 lg:mt-32 lg:pt-12 border-t\"> <h2 class=\"lg:w-1/3 flex flex-col gap-2 mt-0 xl:pr-20 text-xl\"> Availability </h2> <div class=\"lg:w-2/3 mt-8 lg:mt-0\"> <p class=\"md:mt-0\">Our Bella+Canvas 3001 t-shirts are available to order via the following methods and platforms.</p> <ul class=\"flex flex-wrap items-start justify-start mt-4\"> <li class=\"w-1/2 md:w-1/3 mt-16\"> <a href=\"/print-api/\" class=\"text-black hover:no-underline group\" title=\"Print API\"> <div class=\"product--platform h-10 \"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMid\"><path d=\"m6.55847569 26c.32851511 0 .68988173-.0138169 1.08409987-.0414508v-1.9067357c-.15768726.0138169-.45335086.0207254-.8869908.0207254-.63074902 0-1.09724048-.1278066-1.39947438-.3834197-.3022339-.2556132-.45335085-.6459413-.45335085-1.1709845.0131406-.3454231.06241787-.7392055.1478318-1.1813471.08541393-.4421417.17411301-.9119171.26609724-1.4093265.09198423-.4974093.14454665-.9879102.15768725-1.47150