{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_59","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"rg -n -i '.{0,200}<code>sizing</code>.{0,300}' /tmp/prodigi-doc.html | head -30\nrg -n -i '.{0,100}sizing.{0,200}' /tmp/prodigi-doc.html | head -50\"","aggregated_output":"1185:<td><code>sizing</code></td>\n647:            </span><span class=\"nl\">\"sizing\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"fillPrintArea\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n1185:<td><code>sizing</code></td>\n1188:<td>The sizing strategy for us to use. The value should be one of <code>fillPrintArea</code>, <code>fitPrintArea</code> or <code>stretchToPrintArea</code>. More information can be found in our <a href=\"#order-object-image-resizing\" title=\"Image resizing\">image resizing section</a>.</td>\n1291:<h3 id='order-object-image-resizing'>Image resizing</h3>\n1294:<p>However, you can also specify a sizing parameter to change this behaviour.</p>\n1298:<th>Sizing mode</th>\n1324:<p>Pwinty will automatically try to rotate your images so that they need the least possible resizing to fit the product size. For example, if you are creating a 10 x 15 photo, and upload an image that is 4500px x 3000px, then Pwinty will flip it round so it is 3000px x 4500px and thus fits the photo perfectly. </p>\n1361:                \"sizing\": \"fillPrintArea\",\n1443:                </span><span class=\"nl\">\"sizing\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"fillPrintArea\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n1562:                </span><span class=\"nl\">\"sizing\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"fillPrintArea\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n1851:                </span><span class=\"nl\">\"sizing\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"fillPrintArea\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n1986:                </span><span class=\"nl\">\"sizing\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"fillPrintArea\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n2410:                </span><span class=\"nl\">\"sizing\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"fillPrintArea\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n3463:            </span><span class=\"nl\">\"sizing\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"fillPrintArea\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n3639:                </span><span class=\"nl\">\"sizing\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"fillPrintArea\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
